{"title": "Elixir of Barkskin", "pageid": 10686, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Elixir_of_Barkskin", "categories": ["Elixirs", "Uncommon items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-uncommon\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ELX_Elixir_of_Barkskin_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/ELX_Elixir_of_Barkskin_Faded.png/300px-ELX_Elixir_of_Barkskin_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/4/4a/ELX_Elixir_of_Barkskin_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Elixir of Barkskin image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/ELX_Elixir_of_Barkskin_Faded.png/300px-ELX_Elixir_of_Barkskin_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4a/ELX_Elixir_of_Barkskin_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Elixir of Barkskin</b> is an uncommon <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Elixir\">elixir</a> that increases your <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> when drunk.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Before your eyes, the elixir firms into a tough, striated twig, then it liquefies once more.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixirs\" title=\"Elixirs\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/15px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/23px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/30px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elixirs\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/15px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"15\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixirs\" title=\"Elixirs\">Elixirs</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/38px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Single Use\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Single Use</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Uncommon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Uncommon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.1 kg (0.2 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.1 kg (0.2 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 30 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  30  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-6dcf96c0dc97c47fEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-e648e7d23cd85279END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-d484f47fa35790faEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ALCH_Soultion_Elixir_Barkskin</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Soultion_Elixir_Barkskin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Soultion_Elixir_Barkskin\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">cc1a8802-675a-426b-a791-ec1d5a5b6328</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:cc1a8802-675a-426b-a791-ec1d5a5b6328\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:cc1a8802-675a-426b-a791-ec1d5a5b6328\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ALCH_Solution_Elixir_Barkskin</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Solution_Elixir_Barkskin+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Solution_Elixir_Barkskin+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"> <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> </span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Drink to increase your <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> to 16.</li>\n<li>Replaces effects from other elixirs when drunk.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Elixir_of_Barkskin\"> Condition: Elixir of Barkskin </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Barkskin_(Condition)\" title=\"Elixir of Barkskin (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/ELX_Elixir_of_Barkskin_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Elixir_of_Barkskin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/36/ELX_Elixir_of_Barkskin_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-ELX_Elixir_of_Barkskin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/36/ELX_Elixir_of_Barkskin_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-ELX_Elixir_of_Barkskin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elixir of Barkskin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/ELX_Elixir_of_Barkskin_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Elixir_of_Barkskin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/36/ELX_Elixir_of_Barkskin_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Barkskin_(Condition)\" title=\"Elixir of Barkskin (Condition)\">Elixir of Barkskin</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> increased to 16.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Derryth_Bonecloak\" title=\"Derryth Bonecloak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/25px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/38px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/50px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Derryth Bonecloak\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/25px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Derryth_Bonecloak\" title=\"Derryth Bonecloak\">Derryth Bonecloak</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Myconid_Colony\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Myconid Colony\">Myconid Colony</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a>)</li>\n<li>Crafted via <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemy</a> by combining <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Salts_of_Tree_Bark\" title=\"Salts of Tree Bark\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png/20px-Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png/30px-Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png/40px-Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png/20px-Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Salts_of_Tree_Bark\" title=\"Salts of Tree Bark\">Salts of Tree Bark</a> (procured from <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wood_Bark\" title=\"Wood Bark\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Wood_Bark_Item_Icon.png/20px-Wood_Bark_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Wood_Bark_Item_Icon.png/30px-Wood_Bark_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Wood_Bark_Item_Icon.png/40px-Wood_Bark_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Wood_Bark_Item_Icon.png/20px-Wood_Bark_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/43/Wood_Bark_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wood_Bark\" title=\"Wood Bark\">Wood Bark</a>) and any <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\">Suspension</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This elixir sets your AC to the maximum of 16 or your normal AC <em>after</em> any bonuses are applied. For example, this means combining the Elixir of Barkskin with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_of_Faith\" title=\"Shield of Faith\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp/25px-Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp/38px-Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp/50px-Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shield of Faith\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp/25px-Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shield_of_Faith\" title=\"Shield of Faith\">Shield of Faith</a> (+2 AC) <em>will not</em> increase your AC to 18.</li>\n<li>Conversely this means any negative AC effects like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid_(Condition)\" title=\"Acid (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Acid_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/28/Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Acid_(Condition)\" title=\"Acid (Condition)\">Acid</a> will not decrease your AC while under the effects of Barkskin.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Passive_features\">Passive features</span></h2>\n<p>Elixir of Barkskin has 1 <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\">hit point</a>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width: 62%;\">\n<caption>Resistances</caption>\n<tbody><tr><td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a></td><td>Vulnerable</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠